Homepage: https://github.com/f0xx/xenon-mesh

Package: xmeshd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, git
Description: local-first chat for project context and model backends
 One binary serves the chat UI, stores threads in SQLite (or Postgres or
 MariaDB when configured), and calls an OpenAI-compatible, Ollama, or Gemini
 endpoint. A single host is a complete install. A hub is optional and uses
 the same package.
 .
 libgit2 is linked into the binary under GPL-2.0 with the libgit2 linking
 exception. See /usr/share/doc/xmeshd/NOTICE.
